    "chunk_text": "is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t manig yfel mann leofe\u00f0 lange, & manig god mann sone swelt, & eft sum god mann God l\u00e6tt libben \u00fea yfele m\u00e6nn for \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea gode beon \u00feurh heom gefandode, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t heo heo & \u00fea gode m\u00e6nn swelte\u00f0 ra\u00f0e, for \u00fean \u00fee God nele \u00fe\u00e6t heo l\u00e6ng drohtnigen on \u00fean swicolan & eft sume \u00fea gode habbe\u00f0 lang lif, for \u00fean \u00fee heora earninga eh\u00f0 \u00e6lce d\u00e6ige mid godnyssen, & for & eft sume arlease m\u00e6nn sone swelte\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t heo sone habben \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00e6fter eodan, & eac for \u00fean Synden \u00fea m\u00e6nn ges\u00e6lige \u00fee nabbe\u00f0 on \u00feyssen wurlde nane erm\u00f0e? Ac \u00fea syndon eremingas & unges\u00e6lige, \u00fee on eallra ednysse libbe\u00f0 heora lif, & habbe\u00f0 eall heora Ac eadige by\u00f0 \u00fea \u00fea habbe\u00f0 on \u00feyssen wurlde mycelne wane & erm\u00f0e, & is mycel \u00e6fter of heore wille, \u00dea arlease m\u00e6nn \u00feeh heo habben on \u00feysser wurlde sum d\u00e6l heora gewilles, \u00feehhwe\u00f0ere heo by\u00f0 & \u00fea gecorene \u00feeh heo habben \u00e6t sumen s\u00e6le earfo\u00f0nysse on \u00fean middenearde, \u00feehhwe\u00f0ere heo Do me \u00fe\u00e6t to understandene. Yfele m\u00e6nn nabbe\u00f0 nane mihte, for \u00fean \u00fee God is heom gram, heo ne mugen willnigen nanes godes, Heo ne by\u00f0 n\u00e6fre teonlease, for heo by\u00f0 geteontrege\u00f0 mid hindre ge\u00f0anca, & heo by\u00f0 \u00e6fre on \u00dea ha",
